Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "IntersectionCrossTraffic" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :rainy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black vehicle crossing intersection" .

:rainy1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle performing cross-traffic maneuver in path of ego-vehicle" ;
    :confidenceScore "0.90"^^xsd:float ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Vehicle performing cross-traffic maneuver in path of ego-vehicle, creating a potential for lane intrusion or collision.
Severity Score: 0.75